From: baverrr <342259467+baverrr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 12:26:10 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] LatinIME: Let a remote's D-pad type on the keyboard

While the keyboard is shown, the arrows move a focused key, outlined in
the accent, to the nearest key in that direction, and DPAD_CENTER types
it as a tap would (shift, symbols, delete and enter included; long-press
popups are not opened). The first press only shows the focus, which
starts on the first letter, follows layout changes to the nearest key,
and hides again on touch. Both the down and the up of each key used are
consumed; with the keyboard hidden the keys reach the app as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: Ib71bca8a36f1d85117f6cfd0e629e10bc55b8fc1
